      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDeclare the Q/K reciprocal scale buffers and share refresh logic between attention PWAL and post_weights_reload. Cover repeated deferred scale loading and None/materialized placeholders while preserving pointer identity.\n\nTracks #57895.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge #53509 first. This branch starts directly from main and contains only its own change, with no prerequisite PR commits. It is not stacked. Rebase onto main after the prerequisite merges before integration CI. The full recommended sequence is in #57895.\n\n## Validation\n\nLocal Ruff lint/format, Python compilation, diff checks, test-tether checks, and sign-off auditing passed. Linux/backend runtime and graph replay remain pending. Windows pytest collection is blocked by missing uvloop. No H20 or other remote GPU validation was run.\n\n## AI assistance\n\nCode and PR text prepared with AI assistance. Human review and runtime validation remain pending.",
